# surface-zone v1 (LOCKED GATE 3) — vars: {zone}, {identity}
# model: flux_2 pro 1k, aspect 16:9 — reference art for tileset.prompt; not shipped raw
Pixel art game environment concept, outdoor Caracas surface zone at eternal
golden hour: {zone}. Identity: {identity}. El Avila mountain green on the
northern horizon, tropical brutalist buildings, mango and araguaney trees,
warm haze. GBA Pokemon FireRed era 3/4 top-down game perspective, flat cel
shading, crisp pixel art, limited palette dominated by golden-hour amber and
Avila green. No text, no watermark, no people.
